🟠 Strive Director Buys ASST Shares

@Strive board director Pierre Rochard bought 15,900 $ASST shares worth nearly $199,400 at an average $12.54 each.

The purchase comes as #Strive’s $SATA preferred stock approaches its $100 par value and the company holds 20,246 bitcoin:native https://t.co/IbV35rvsH2
